OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fevening showers will be interspersed
OL,7,Fwith the odd occasional clear spell.
OL,8,FThese showers will continue overnight,
OL,9,Fbefore easing for a time towards the
OL,10,Fmorning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FDry, bright at first but
OL,13,Fblustery, locally heavy and wintry
OL,14,Fshowers soon spread southeast. These
OL,15,Fshowers become less frequent from late
OL,16,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
