OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCold
OL,6,Fwith blustery and wintry showers
OL,7,FThursday. Less cold with showery rain
OL,8,FFriday becoming breezy with increasing
OL,9,Foutbreaks of showery rain Saturday.
